license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
keywords:
  - LLM security
  - prompt injection
  - text-to-Cypher
  - GraphRAG
  - Neo4j
abstract: "A minimal question-answering pipeline over a Neo4j graph (a model writes Cypher, the database runs it, a second model call writes the answer) with switchable protections, used to measure what small local models get wrong and what protections do. Synthetic data only."
